A||||5||MooCow||How to move the firewall??||||1||
Z||000000||MooCow||08-27-2000||10:37 AM||||Does anyone here know how to move the firewall by chance??  I am doing the sub conversion into the first firewall but am not sure how deep nor how to get it off?  Can I just drill out the rivits and then pull it off??  How much room is between the two?? Anyone??<P>                             Thanks Ken||||reg||1
Z||000001||TheFiero64||08-27-2000||03:19 PM||||I think you have to cut the hole. The firewall is welded to the car and can't be removed. when you cut watch out the gas tube runs through there.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TheFiero64_signature1.gif"> ||||reg||3
Z||000002||286SE'S||08-30-2000||07:02 PM||||Use the search engine and look for "firewall subwoofer. There has been lots of discussions about this and you don't get much extra space by cutting. The deepest measurement is 2 1/2"<BR>in perhaps a 6X10" odd shaped hole.<BR>here is a link to one of the discussions:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/003539.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/003539.html</A> <P>Terry||||reg||1
Z||000003||fierosound||08-30-2000||08:05 PM||||These website will give you full details...<P> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierosound/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fierosound/</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/003613.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/003613.html</A> <P>||||reg||10
